   "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;\">\n  <strong>📋 Job Applicant Portal Field Configuration</strong><br/>\n  <ul style=\"margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0;\">\n    <li>Add rows to the table below specifying which <strong>Job Applicant</strong> fields to expose in the candidate portal.</li>\n    <li>Set <strong>Tab</strong> and <strong>Section</strong> to control how fields are grouped in the portal form.</li>\n    <li>Use <strong>Mandatory</strong> to enforce required fields on the candidate side.</li>\n    <li>Use <strong>Read Only</strong> to display pre-filled values that the candidate cannot change.</li>\n    <li>Click <strong>Fetch Available Fields</strong> to see and auto-fill field metadata from Job Applicant.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
